{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24043","headline":"古意 · 白居易","name":"古意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"脉脉复脉脉，美人千里隔。\n不见来几时，瑶草三四碧。\n玉琴声悄悄，鸾镜尘幂幂。\n昔爲连理枝，今作分飞翮。\n寄书多不达，加饭终无益。\n心肠不自宽，衣带何由窄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24043.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24043","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}